   "restBasis": {
    "zh": "静止值 = 标准体：中国 20–24 岁均值的身高和 BMI；腿长因子 −1 和前臂 ×0.93 是对 ANSUR 比例的修正（依据 GB/T 10000-1988 P50 与模型的对比）；其余比例和围度函数来自 ANSUR II / NHANES（美国数据），不是中国实测。",
    "en": "rest = the standard body: stature and BMI are the Chinese 20-24 means; leg-length factor -1 and forearm x0.93 are corrections to ANSUR proportions (from GB/T 10000-1988 P50 against the model); all other proportion and girth functions come from ANSUR II / NHANES (US data), not Chinese measurements."
